Begin Add a New Document Type
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Chart" charttab
	Click the "Document Types" charttab subtab
	Click the "Add Document Type" link
	Type TESTDOX in the "Document type" field
	Type "This is a better doc type"  in the Description field
	Check PDF field
	Click the Submit button
	Verify exists "Document type (TESTDOX) has been created successfully!" text
